</span><span class=\"tr\">圈</span><rt>juàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pò\" data-defn=\"to break, split or cleave / to get rid of / to destroy / to break with / to defeat / to capture (a city etc) / to expose the truth of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">破</span><span class=\"tr\">破</span><rt>pò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dòng\" data-defn=\"cave / hole / zero (unambiguous spoken form when spelling out numbers)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">洞</span><span class=\"tr\">洞</span><rt>dòng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǎn shang\" data-defn=\"in the evening\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shang</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"láng\" data-defn=\"wolf\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">狼</span><span class=\"tr\">狼</span><rt>láng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cóng\" data-defn=\"from; through; via / (bound form) retainer; attendant / (bound form) assistant; auxiliary; subordinate / (bound form) related by common paternal grandfather or earlier ancestor\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dòng\" data-defn=\"cave / hole / zero (unambiguous spoken form when spelling out numbers)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">洞</span><span class=\"tr\">洞</span><rt>dòng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǐ\" data-defn=\"lining / interior / inside\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">里</span><spa