lass=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">&quot;</span><span class=\"tr\">&quot;</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gǎn kuài\" data-defn=\"quickly; at once\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">赶快</span><span class=\"tr\">趕快</span><rt>gǎn kuài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bǎ\" data-defn=\"(used to put the object before the verb: 把[ba3] + {noun} + {verb})\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yáng\" data-defn=\"sheep; goat\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">羊</span><span class=\"tr\">羊</span><rt>yáng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"juàn\" data-defn=\"livestock enclosure; pen; fold; sty\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">圈</span><span class=\"tr\">圈</span><rt>juàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiū yī xiū\" data-defn=\"to give something a quick repair; fix up a little\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">修一修</span><span class=\"tr\">修一修</span><rt>xiū yī xiū</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dǔ zhù\" data-defn=\"to block up\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">堵住</span><span class=\"tr\">堵住</span><rt>dǔ zhù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"(specifier) that; the; those / (pronoun) that (referring to persons, things or situations)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dòng\" data-defn=\"cave / hole / zero (unambiguous